### Config Server default
GET http://localhost:8888/patient-service/default

### Config Server dev
GET http://localhost:8888/patient-service/dev

### Config Server prod
GET http://localhost:8888/patient-service/prod

### Welcome default/dev
GET http://localhost:8081/welcome

### Create Patient default/dev
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van An",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-05-20",
  "gender": "Nam",
  "phoneNumber": "0912345678",
  "address": "Ha Noi",
  "medicalHistory": "Di ung Penicillin"
}

### Refresh default/dev
POST http://localhost:8081/actuator/refresh

### Prod welcome
GET http://localhost:8082/welcome

### Prod refresh
POST http://localhost:8082/actuator/refresh
